    "%arg is running in the active pane in %arg. Closing the pane will terminate %arg." : {
      "comment" : "Body of the close-pane confirmation dialog when a live agent process is the risk. First and third arguments are the agent name (e.g. Claude Code), second is the bidi-isolated workspace title."
